      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We can start by stating that our company values diversity of thought, but also expects employees to maintain a professional demeanor in the workplace. This means refraining from using company resources to promote partisan ideologies or engaging in heated debates that may make others uncomfortable. We'll establish clear guidelines for respectful communication and ensure that our policies align with the First Amendment, protecting employees' right to free speech outside of work hours.",
